{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shred\u2019n\u2019Spread</strong> is a charmingly chaotic <strong>retro idle-clicker game</strong>, inspired by the style of classic point-and-click adventures, but with a modern, humorous gameplay twist.<br><strong>Drag &amp; drop</strong> snacks, toss them into your shredder, and watch your Kaiju devour everything.<br>With every bite, it grows \u2013 leaving behind shiny evidence of its satisfaction: <strong>gold!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Loop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.\u00a0 Order snacks </strong>through your phone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140390/extras/59d9310e9af0957ae2a191a1260f6312.poster.avif?t=1765631979\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140390/extras/59d9310e9af0957ae2a191a1260f6312.webm?t=1765631979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140390/extras/59d9310e9af0957ae2a191a1260f6312.mp4?t=1765631979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2.\u00a0 Drag &amp; drop </strong>them into the shredder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3.\u00a0 Spray the tasty </strong>chaos at your Kaiju</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140390/extras/0d23cfb9820d9d4098dff47e657812cf.poster.avif?t=1765631979\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140390/extras/0d23cfb9820d9d4098dff47e657812cf.webm?t=1765631979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140390/extras/0d23cfb9820d9d4098dff47e657812cf.mp4?t=1765631979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4.\u00a0 Collect gold </strong>and upgrade your machine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5.\u00a0 Watch your Kaiju evolve \u2014 </strong>from tiny terror to planet devourer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140390/extras/0b7271b778e7d476de43ff40b1ef9e69.poster.avif?t=1765631979\" width=672 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140390/extras/0b7271b778e7d476de43ff40b1ef9e69.webm?t=1765631979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong><br><strong>\u2022 Drag &amp; Snack gameplay </strong>\u2013 Shred, Spray, Feed, Grow<br><strong>\u2022 Charming pixel art </strong>inspired by 90s point-and-click classics<br><strong>\u2022 Two Kaiju paths \u2013 </strong>Carnivore or Herbivore <br><strong>\u2022 Upgradeable shredder \u2013 </strong>boost power, size, speed and tuning<br><strong>\u2022 Phone-based snack </strong>delivery system<br><strong>\u2022 Absurd humor </strong>&amp; golden surprises at every turn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with a mix of AI tools and human touch \u2013 recorded, remixed, and lovingly polished in Audacity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4140390?t=1765631979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140390/edb5ce